762
01:03:37.908 --> 01:03:41.695
working conditions are safe and hygienic,

763
01:03:41.910 --> 01:03:49.397
Child labor shall not be used, living
wages are paid, working hours are not

764
01:03:49.397 --> 01:03:50.395
