765
01:03:50.415 --> 01:03:56.045
There is no discrimination. Regular
employment is provided.

766
01:03:56.085 --> 01:03:59.945
There is no harsh or inhumane treatment.

767
01:04:00.395 --> 01:04:02.995
Questi sono i principi base

768
01:04:03.099 --> 01:04:08.218
che le aziende che fanno parte dell'ETI si
