783
01:05:02.929 --> 01:05:08.695
It is also true that there are complex
social problems related to this industry.

784
01:05:09.230 --> 01:05:14.683
During the period between the picking of a
banana and its purchase, the fruit can

785
01:05:14.683 --> 01:05:17.645
