786
01:05:17.985 --> 01:05:21.395
However, its cost remains very low.

787
01:05:21.522 --> 01:05:27.745
How is it possible? It means that someone
in the supply chain is paying for it.

788
01:05:27.907 --> 01:05:32.493
In the case of bananas, the cost of
conventional, non-Fairtrade certified

789
01:05:32.513 --> 01:05:35.195
bananas falls on the farmers, who

790
01:05:35.212 --> 01:05:41.195
